Ross?

23
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:22,900
Ross?

24
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:28,620
Can we just close the door?

25
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:32,160
Friends S10E02 The One Where Ross Is Fine

26
