228
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:34,440
Well, that first batch of margaritas was not so great...

229
00:11:34,490 --> 00:11:37,880
...but this second batch is good.

230
00:11:39,590 --> 00:11:41,280
Well, maybe the next batch,

231
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,360
