263
00:13:10,810 --> 00:13:12,500
Alice would never go for it.Right?

264
00:13:12,550 --> 00:13:14,500
I don't know. She's pretty tired too.

265
00:13:14,500 --> 00:13:15,710
I think we could get her on board.

266
